Package: ersec
Version: 29.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ERSEC Project <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-requests (>= 2.31), python3-urllib3 (>= 2.0), python3-bs4 (>= 4.12), python3-yaml (>= 6), python3-defusedxml (>= 0.7.1)
Description: Evidence-driven application security platform
 ERSEC 29.1.0 combines bounded web/API security testing, evidence-backed reasoning,
 security behavior modeling, security contracts, continuous assurance, remediation verification, a Security
 Control Plane, and an application-layer runtime Shield.
 .
 The package is designed for authorized, bounded, non-destructive security assessment.
